WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.841
Bot drove the spaceship to the shore.

2
00:00:12.842 --> 00:00:19.906
Ringo and Bot went outside.

3
00:00:19.907 --> 00:00:22.684
Rumble! Rumble!

4
00:00:22.685 --> 00:00:25.431
Mount Magma shook.

5
00:00:25.432 --> 00:00:28.821
Black ash sprayed from its top.

6
00:00:28.822 --> 00:00:38.753
"We need to find those birds fast," Ringo said.

7
00:00:38.754 --> 00:00:42.898
"I'm sure the birds are not far," Bot said.

8
00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:46.582
"Boomberries only grow near the volcano."

9
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:59.526
"Good," Ringo said.

10
00:00:59.527 --> 00:01:02.296
Ringo started looking for the birds.

11
00:01:02.297 --> 00:01:09.482
Bot rolled along behind him.

12
00:01:09.483 --> 00:01:13.324
Then she saw a broken tree.

13
00:01:13.325 --> 00:01:15.949
"Hmm," Bot said.

14
00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:21.523
"That's a boomberry tree."

15
00:01:21.524 --> 00:01:26.187
Bot zoomed closer to the tree.

16
00:01:26.188 --> 00:01:34.866
She looked around.

17
00:01:34.867 --> 00:01:38.754
"I think the birds were here," she said.

18
00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:41.757
"But I don't see them now."

19
00:01:41.758 --> 00:01:47.320
Ringo stopped to catch his breath.

20
00:01:47.321 --> 00:01:50.033
He spotted something on the ground.

21
00:01:50.034 --> 00:01:54.127
He gasped. "Those look like . . ."

22
00:01:54.128 --> 00:01:57.318
"Bird prints!" Bot said.

23
00:01:57.319 --> 00:02:01.575
"Right!" Ringo said. "Let's follow them and—"

24
00:02:01.576 --> 00:02:04.156
Rumble! Rumble!

25
00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:08.543
The volcano was getting louder.

26
00:02:08.544 --> 00:02:11.381
Black clouds filled the sky.

27
00:02:11.382 --> 00:02:22.000
Ringo gulped. "Captain Nova was right.

28
00:02:22.001 --> 00:02:33.561
This mission is very dangerous."

29
00:02:33.562 --> 00:02:36.509
"Uh-oh," Bot said.

30
00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:39.059
"Look at the prints!

31
00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:46.454
They go through the bushes—to the volcano!"

